  "question": {
    "text": "Isomeric hydrocarbons $\\quad \\rightarrow \\quad$ negative Baeyer's test\n(Molecular formula $\\mathrm{C}_9 \\mathrm{H}_{12}$ )\n\nThe total number of isomers from above with four different non-aliphatic substitution sites is -",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n\\text { Degree of unsaturation } & =\\mathrm{C}+1-\\frac{\\mathrm{H}}{2} \\\\\n& =9+1-6=4\n\\end{aligned}$\nBenzene shows negative Baeyer's test\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/GlVDgXuDRgbvJesKMzC-dBAtUFPGvUVE6VECLty-sxo.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nBoth compounds have four different non-aliphatic substitution sites.",
